{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harventure</strong> is an incremental game inspired by <i>To the Core</i> and <i>Nodebuster</i>. Harvest resources, explore unique islands, and upgrade your skill tree.<br>Collect all the resources from each island to finally destroy the corruption that plagues it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The corruption runs deeper with every new island. Will you be able to cleanse them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 3 to 4 hours of relaxing harvesting and satisfying upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/Long_Description_1.png?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The islands are rich in resources, be prepared to harvest them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will start from wood and stone up to more precious resources, use them to upgrade the skill tree or learn new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/Long_Description_2.png?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your skill tree, spend resources to unlock new upgrades, learn powerful abilities, and unlock automation for harvesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/Long_Description_3.png?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new islands each with its unique biome and resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806350?t=1749669482","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806350?t=1749669482","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/28347f9fc846509915228cbb40fd6020602dab57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749669482","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/28347f9fc846509915228cbb40fd6020602dab57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749669482","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Harventure</strong> is an incremental game inspired by <i>To the Core</i> and <i>Nodebuster</i>. Harvest resources, explore unique islands, and upgrade your skill tree.<br>Collect all the resources from each island to finally destroy the corruption that plagues it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The corruption runs deeper with every new island. Will you be able to cleanse them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy 3 to 4 hours of relaxing harvesting and satisfying upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806350/extras/Long_Description_1.png?t=1749669482\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=